  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It behaves very similarly to a regular Green Shield Bug, using bites, charges, jumps, and large gas clouds to control the area. The main difference is that it often appears as part of O.R.C. encounters alongside other threats.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is tougher than a regular Green Shield Bug and can be especially dangerous during a wave. Its gas still severely limits available space while other O.R.C. creatures pressure the player.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It appears in O.R.C. fights alongside other creatures, so its role is not always to attack you alone: its gas clouds and large body can greatly complicate a battle that already contains several enemies.",
  "strategy": "Use Stabbing damage with a Fresh infusion, bring gas protection, and avoid remaining inside its clouds. If the encounter allows turrets, prioritize using them against this creature because O.R.C. variants take roughly triple turret damage. During waves, try to kill it before the gas begins covering the area you are defending.",
